00:02:53,229 --> 00:02:53,694
occupied.

66
00:02:54,689 --> 00:02:57,530
For that, here in set, once we got the key

67
00:02:57,562 --> 00:02:57,835
hash

68
00:02:58,942 --> 00:03:00,354
where the item should be stored,

69
00:03:01,189 --> 00:03:04,816
I check if in my buckets this place is still

