84
00:03:40,181 --> 00:03:42,654
And we can do this with a simple

85
00:03:43,489 --> 00:03:44,147
while loop.

86
00:03:45,034 --> 00:03:45,982
We simply check

87
00:03:46,866 --> 00:03:47,074
if

88
00:03:47,926 --> 00:03:48,842
this condition here

89
00:03:51,123 --> 00:03:52,441
