00:03:55,629 --> 00:03:57,226
find a place where this is null.

92
00:03:58,049 --> 00:04:00,969
And we simply change the key hash now. So we

93
00:04:00,969 --> 00:04:04,035
turn this from const to let so that inside

94
00:04:04,035 --> 00:04:06,773
of the while loop, I can simply increment

95
00:04:06,773 --> 00:04:06,822
it.

96
00:04:07,418 --> 00:04:09,448
Keep in mind that this is just a number. So

97
00:04:09,448 --> 00:04:11,462
now we can add 1 to it and look into the

98
00:04:11,462 --> 00:04:13,721
next bucket. And then in the next one and

99
00:04:13,802 --> 00:04:16,404
the next one and so on. And we keep on

100
00:04:16,469 --> 00:04:19,248
looping until we find a place where we do

101
00:04:19,361 --> 00:04:21,996
have null as a value. The loop keeps on

102
00:04:21,996 --> 00:04:24,149
running as long as it's not null. As soon as

103
00:04:24,181 --> 00:04:27,073
we do find a place where it is null, we have

