106
00:04:30,527 --> 00:04:32,519
And therefore, after the loop, we know that

107
00:04:32,519 --> 00:04:35,315
we found an empty index, an empty place,

108
00:04:35,845 --> 00:04:37,870
and therefore now we can reach out to this

109
00:04:38,079 --> 00:04:40,992
