00:04:56,968 --> 00:04:59,732
same hash, but we don't necessarily store a

117
00:04:59,732 --> 00:05:03,349
value at that hash, at that index. Then we

118
00:05:03,349 --> 00:05:05,085
might store it at a different index.

119
00:05:05,897 --> 00:05:08,661
Hence here, when I store something, I also

120
00:05:08,661 --> 00:05:10,910
store information about the key and about

121
00:05:10,910 --> 00:05:12,999
the value. So the same as we did it with

