00:05:13,128 --> 00:05:15,922
chaining, now just a different approach for

123
00:05:16,134 --> 00:05:17,161
where we store this.

124
00:05:17,748 --> 00:05:19,851
So we should do this whenever we write to

125
00:05:19,949 --> 00:05:20,601
our buckets.

126
00:05:22,640 --> 00:05:25,087
So now for extracting a value, I want to go

127
00:05:25,103 --> 00:05:25,395
through

128
00:05:25,979 --> 00:05:26,417
all my

129
00:05:27,033 --> 00:05:27,665
places

130
00:05:28,329 --> 00:05:31,085
in my buckets array, so through all elements

131
00:05:31,085 --> 00:05:31,912
in my buckets array

