00:05:38,530 --> 00:05:41,790
smaller than this bucket's length and

135
00:05:41,886 --> 00:05:43,909
increment i after every iteration.

136
00:05:44,455 --> 00:05:46,478
And I want to now search for that key.

137
00:05:47,120 --> 00:05:50,059
So for all the buckets which I'm looking at,

138
00:05:50,460 --> 00:05:53,382
I want to check if in there I have a value

139
00:05:53,382 --> 00:05:56,353
stored for this specific key. So I'll check

140
00:05:56,481 --> 00:05:58,721
if this bucket's for the given

141
00:05:59,303 --> 00:05:59,319
i,

142
00:05:59,966 --> 00:06:01,712
so the given key hash which is being

143
00:06:01,728 --> 00:06:03,038
incremented after every loop,

144
00:06:03,749 --> 00:06:06,627
if the key stored in there is equal

